<div class="pix-modal" id="pixModal"><h3><i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart"></i> Apoie com Pix</h3><p style="color:white; text-align:center;">Chave Pix (telefone):<br><strong style="font-size:1.4rem;">12988461978</strong></p><button id="copyPixBtn" class="close-pix" style="background:#25D366;"><i class="fas fa-copy"></i> Copiar chave</button><button id="closePixBtn" class="close-pix">Fechar</button></div>
